    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for connection lifecycle management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Guarantees cleanup on all exit paths:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Scope exit (normal)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Exception throws (unwinding)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Early returns (short-circuit)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe design:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Move semantics (exclusive ownership transfer)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No copying (prevents accidental double-cleanup)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Atomic release flag (prevents double-release)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Example usage: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>guard<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1index_1a0dde061255abf06c330901e79f19756c" kindref="member">makeConnectionGuard</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>[&amp;]<sp/>{<sp/>db_.releaseConnection(connection_id);<sp/>},</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>connection_id);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">performDatabaseOperation();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Scope<sp/>exit:<sp/>guard<sp/>cleanup<sp/>triggered</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Phase 3 A-6: Gap A-6.1 through A-6.34 (34 connection leak sites) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
